<title>USA: Dauphin Deposit Sept 30 Q3 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Dauphin Deposit Sept 30 Q3 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>HARRISBURG, Pa. 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.58		    $0.55</p>
<p> Net			 17,947		   16,875</p>
<p> Net interest inc	45,725		   43,714</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  30,794		   30,893</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.68		    $1.56</p>
<p> Net			 51,653		   48,171</p>
<p> Net interest inc     135,138		  130,917</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  30,777		   30,969</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Full company name is Dauphin Deposit Corp</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said it expected 1996 to be a record year, and that loan growth remained strong, particularly on the consumer side.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
